{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.poster.avif?t=1761065797\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.webm?t=1761065797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/045245fceb0ad048f361d90f5118c539.mp4?t=1761065797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This playable demo offers a glimpse into the cursed wheat fields of <i>No One Leaves the Field</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll wake beside your locked car, stranded in the middle of nowhere. The farmhouse flickers in the distance\u2014but something is moving in the wheat. Explore the field, uncover clues about what happened to the family who lived here, and piece together the ritual that sealed their fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/fcf626ec0f16c76be79657ca90613a8d.poster.avif?t=1761065797\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/fcf626ec0f16c76be79657ca90613a8d.webm?t=1761065797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/fcf626ec0f16c76be79657ca90613a8d.mp4?t=1761065797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A self-contained story arc introducing the curse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental storytelling through notes and objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light puzzle-solving and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic sound design and atmospheric horror (Headphones Recommended)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English, Spanish, and Portuguese localization</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape the field... or will you become part of it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/6ebd5c8b9d6e9d478f3ad8137e99703d.poster.avif?t=1761065797\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/6ebd5c8b9d6e9d478f3ad8137e99703d.webm?t=1761065797\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/extras/6ebd5c8b9d6e9d478f3ad8137e99703d.mp4?t=1761065797\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4104110?t=1761065797","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/b18f4de2931564def4275c75ab2b0f28de63c2a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761065797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/c6ffb2357caa89e0fc1934392e2c9cc0a4edb6bc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761065797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4104110/c6ffb2357caa89e0fc1934392e2c9cc0a4edb6bc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761065797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"descri